### Register a normal user (18+, vegetarian)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ioanapotlog",
  "email": "ioanapoltog@gmail.com",
  "password": "Ioan@2003",
  "nickname": "Ioana",
  "bio": "I love cooking and baking!",
  "age": 21,
  "authorization": false,
  "vegetarian": true,
  "role": "USER"
}

### Register a normal user (18+, non-vegetarian)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
